{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "protocol_id": "news-sentiment-v1",
  "status": "FROZEN_BEFORE_COLLECTION",
  "purpose": "Collect public crypto news and Reddit headlines, score them with a frozen word list, aggregate daily market and per-coin sentiment, and evaluate four frozen strategies on forward data only.",
  "registration_note": "Frozen 2026-10-01 before the first item is collected. No historical news archive is available for free, so nothing here is backtested: collection starts now, strategies are scored only from prospective_start_utc (after a 30-day baseline). Scoring is a transparent word-list model (no paid API). X/Twitter is excluded: scraping violates its terms and the official API is paid. Satisfies AGENTS.md: news becomes a strategy input only through this separately frozen specification. Pre-collection adjustment (2026-10-01, from a local test run whose items were discarded): request pause raised from 3 s to 10 s because Reddit rate-limits back-to-back requests.",
